sequenceDiagram
  title One AI chat turn
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant M as Language model
  participant C as diagram-core
  participant D as Database
  U->>W: "Add a payment service under the API"
  W->>A: POST /diagrams/:id/chat/messages
  A->>D: Persona, history, settings
  A->>C: Describe the diagram (shapes, positions, groups, violations)
  loop up to 5 steps (8 under a standard)
    A->>M: System prompt, history, tools for this family
    M-->>A: Tool calls
    A->>C: Run each tool on the model
    C-->>A: New model, outcome, new violations
  end
  A->>D: Save the turn and the token usage
  A-->>W: Reply, changes made, the updated diagram text
  W->>U: The edit, unsaved until Save
